@startuml
title <size:24>Container View: Astronomy Shop</size>\n<size:24>The services and data stores inside the Astronomy Shop, and how they call each other. Cross-cutting feature-flag and telemetry wiring is shown in separate views.</size>

set separator none
left to right direction
skinparam ranksep 20
skinparam nodesep 5
hide stereotype

